{{!
    @template theme_dimensions/category_card_modal

    The sheet and the actions of one course's "More information" dialogue, rendered in the browser by
    categorycoursemodal into core/modal's body and footer (the frame is category_course_modal).

    Two halves, as the dialogue has two kinds of content. What the card already decided arrives from
    the card's own markup when the reader presses its link: the cover (imageurl), the state pill
    (badge), the title (fullname), the kicker and the two buttons (primary, secondary), which the card
    writes onto its link from its context's modal keys. What only the dialogue shows - the excerpt, the
    fact tiles and the programme's first lines with their labels - is theme_dimensions_get_course_dialogue's
    answer. The dialogue opens at once with the first half and loading set, which draws a skeleton in
    the content region; the module renders this template again once the answer is in and moves only the
    new content region into the open dialogue, so the title that labels it is never replaced. A failed
    request keeps the header and the buttons and says so in one sentence, with the course's own page.

    With tool_courserating rating the course, the answer carries a rating block too, below the excerpt: the
    average large, its five stars and the count (hidden from a screen reader, which is told the rating's
    sentence), the distribution as five progress elements (never a width written into a style attribute),
    and, where the plugin lets the viewer read its reviews, the plugin's own trigger of its reviews popup: an
    element matching its listener's .tool_courserating-cfield .tool_courserating-ratings, named by the class
    tool_courserating-ratings-courseid-<id>, which categorycoursemodal lets through after closing this dialogue.

    Three parts, each named by a hook: the sheet (the cover with the pill, the kicker and the title over
    its gradient, then the content region), the content region inside it, and the actions. The title
    carries core's own title hook and no id of its own: the module gives it the id core/modal's root is
    labelled by, and a page holds many cards and one dialogue.

    The primary button is a link, or - for a course whose enrolment opens later - a button that is
    aria-disabled, never disabled: a disabled button leaves the focus order, and a screen reader must
    still reach the one place the opening date is printed and hear why it does nothing. Every icon is
    decorative; the words carry the meaning.

    Every text value arrives in the plain spelling and is escaped here.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "fullname": "Pre-hospital Care & Rescue",
        "imageurl": "https://example.com/pluginfile.php/31/course/overviewfiles/capa.jpg",
        "hasimage": true,
        "badge": {"label": "Open for enrolment", "classes": "dim-badge dim-badge--open", "icon": "fa-right-to-bracket"},
        "kicker": "Brigade",
        "haskicker": true,
        "primary": {"label": "Enrol", "url": "https://example.com/theme/dimensions/landing.php?id=42", "disabled": false, "note": "", "icon": "fa-arrow-right"},
        "hasprimary": true,
        "secondary": {"label": "Course page", "url": "https://example.com/course/view.php?id=42"},
        "hassecondary": true,
        "loading": false,
        "failed": false,
        "failedlabel": "",
        "failedurl": "",
        "failedlink": "",
        "excerpt": "Pre-hospital care course for volunteer brigade members.",
        "hasexcerpt": true,
        "facts": [
            {"label": "Workload", "value": "36 hours", "icon": "fa-clock"},
            {"label": "Modality", "value": "In-person", "icon": "fa-display"},
            {"label": "Venue", "value": "Central Campus · São Paulo", "icon": "fa-location-dot"}
        ],
        "hasfacts": true,
        "factslabel": "Course information",
        "learn": ["Victim triage", "Immobilisation", "Safe transport"],
        "haslearn": true,
        "learnlabel": "What you will learn",
        "rating": {
            "avg": "4.7",
            "count": 23,
            "label": "Rating 4.7 out of 5, 23 ratings",
            "courseid": 42,
            "heading": "Ratings",
            "counttext": "23 ratings",
            "stars": [
                {"icon": "fa-solid fa-star"},
                {"icon": "fa-solid fa-star"},
                {"icon": "fa-solid fa-star"},
                {"icon": "fa-solid fa-star"},
                {"icon": "fa-solid fa-star-half-stroke"}
            ],
            "distribution": [
                {"stars": 5, "count": 17, "label": "5 stars: 17"},
                {"stars": 4, "count": 4, "label": "4 stars: 4"},
                {"stars": 3, "count": 1, "label": "3 stars: 1"},
                {"stars": 2, "count": 1, "label": "2 stars: 1"},
                {"stars": 1, "count": 0, "label": "1 star: 0"}
            ],
            "reviews": 9,
            "hasreviewslink": true,
            "reviewslabel": "Read 9 reviews"
        },
        "hasrating": true
    }
}}
<div class="dim-cmodal__sheet" data-region="dim-cmodal-sheet">
    <div class="dim-cmodal__cover{{#hasimage}} dim-cmodal__cover--image{{/hasimage}}">
        {{#hasimage}}
        <img class="dim-cmodal__image" src="{{imageurl}}" alt="" decoding="async">
        {{/hasimage}}
        {{#badge}}
        <span class="dim-cmodal__pill {{classes}}"><i class="fa {{icon}}" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{label}}</span>
        {{/badge}}
        <div class="dim-cmodal__heading">
            {{#haskicker}}
            <p class="dim-cmodal__kicker">{{kicker}}</p>
            {{/haskicker}}
            <h2 class="dim-cmodal__title" data-region="title" tabindex="-1">{{fullname}}</h2>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="dim-cmodal__columns" data-region="dim-cmodal-content"{{#loading}} aria-busy="true"{{/loading}}>
        {{#loading}}
        <div class="dim-cmodal__skeleton" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="dim-cmodal__bone"></span>
            <span class="dim-cmodal__bone"></span>
            <span class="dim-cmodal__bone dim-cmodal__bone--short"></span>
        </div>
        {{/loading}}
        {{#failed}}
        <p class="dim-cmodal__failed">{{failedlabel}} <a href="{{failedurl}}">{{failedlink}}</a></p>
        {{/failed}}
        {{^loading}}{{^failed}}
        <div class="dim-cmodal__main">
            {{#hasexcerpt}}
            <p class="dim-cmodal__summary">{{excerpt}}</p>
            {{/hasexcerpt}}
            {{#rating}}
            <section class="dim-cmodal__rating" data-region="dim-cmodal-rating">
                <h3 class="dim-cmodal__learnlabel">{{heading}}</h3>
                <div class="dim-cmodal__ratingsummary">
                    <p class="dim-cmodal__ratingavg"><span aria-hidden="true">{{avg}}</span><span class="visually-hidden">{{label}}</span></p>
                    <div class="dim-cmodal__ratingside" aria-hidden="true">
                        <span class="dim-cmodal__stars">{{#stars}}<i class="{{icon}}" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{/stars}}</span>
                        <span class="dim-cmodal__ratingcount">{{counttext}}</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <ul class="dim-cmodal__distribution">
                    {{#distribution}}
                    <li class="dim-cmodal__ratingrow"><span class="dim-cmodal__rowstars" aria-hidden="true">{{stars}} <i class="fa fa-star" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><progress class="dim-cmodal__bar" max="{{rating.count}}" value="{{count}}" aria-label="{{label}}"></progress><span class="dim-cmodal__rowcount" aria-hidden="true">{{count}}</span></li>
                    {{/distribution}}
                </ul>
                {{#hasreviewslink}}
                <span class="tool_courserating-cfield"><button type="button" class="btn btn-link dim-cmodal__reviews tool_courserating-ratings tool_courserating-ratings-courseid-{{courseid}}" data-region="dim-cmodal-reviews">{{reviewslabel}}</button></span>
                {{/hasreviewslink}}
            </section>
            {{/rating}}
            {{#haslearn}}
            <h3 class="dim-cmodal__learnlabel">{{learnlabel}}</h3>
            <ul class="dim-cmodal__learn">
                {{#learn}}
                <li><span class="dim-cmodal__check"><i class="fa fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span>{{.}}</span></li>
                {{/learn}}
            </ul>
            {{/haslearn}}
        </div>
        {{#hasfacts}}
        <ul class="dim-cmodal__facts" aria-label="{{factslabel}}">
            {{#facts}}
            <li class="dim-cmodal__fact"><span class="dim-cmodal__facticon"><i class="fa {{icon}}" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span class="dim-cmodal__facttext"><span class="dim-cmodal__factlabel">{{label}}</span> <b class="dim-cmodal__factvalue">{{value}}</b></span></li>
            {{/facts}}
        </ul>
        {{/hasfacts}}
        {{/failed}}{{/loading}}
    </div>
</div>
<div class="dim-cmodal__actions" data-region="dim-cmodal-actions">
    {{#secondary}}
    <a class="btn dim-cmodal__button dim-cmodal__button--secondary" href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>
    {{/secondary}}
    {{#primary}}
    {{#disabled}}
    <button type="button" class="btn dim-cmodal__button dim-cmodal__button--closed" aria-disabled="true" data-region="dim-cmodal-closed"><i class="fa {{icon}}" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{label}}<span class="visually-hidden"> {{note}}</span></button>
    {{/disabled}}
    {{^disabled}}
    <a class="btn dim-cmodal__button dim-cmodal__button--primary" href="{{url}}">{{label}} <i class="fa {{icon}}" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
    {{/disabled}}
    {{/primary}}
</div>
